	},
	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010020"},
		line=971,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Monday morning, five-thirty of the clock.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"On weekday mornings, I always practice with my wooden blade in the Imperial Temple's dojo.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Before the war, I studied blade arts alongside Hotori in the dojo of the Inou School─the Myougikan.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"My master was, of course, Inou Kokuan-dono.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"He was a paragon of not only bladesmanship, but of virtue as well.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"No, “was” isn't right.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"He may have been arrested by the Republic in the August Incident, but that doesn't mean he's dead.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"I swing my wooden blade again to shake off these idle thoughts.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"The core precept of the Inou School is “heart and blade in concord.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"That is to say, your blade should be a mere extension of your heart.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Your impulses manifest themselves in your bladework.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"If your heart goes awry, so shall your blade, and your life will be forfeit.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Thus, it is vital to wield your blade free from obstructive thoughts.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"I am still far from reaching that ideal state.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Alright.)”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"I finish up my training.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"I bow to the altar and withdraw to the edge of the dojo.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Hotori is sitting there, just as always.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I didn't think you'd come today.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Training is a warrior's duty.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Anyways, what's Miyaguni up to?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't tell me you two are still sleeping in the same room.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The manager was kind enough to let her stay in the room next to mine.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You're kidding...”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What reason do I have to joke about that?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"The building I live in is owned by the manager.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Koujiya Flowers is on the first floor, and the floors above it are available for lease.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"The room next to mine has been vacant for the past half year.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As for her, she spent all of yesterday recovering her strength.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thanks to the manager's Healing, she can attend school starting today.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She's going to school. By her own request.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I still haven't recognized her, you know.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I know.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You totally don't get it at all!”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I said I'd kill her next time I saw her, right? If she comes to school, I'm definitely going to run into her...”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I know that, too.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Stop taking this so lightly, jeez...”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"With a pout on her face, Hotori begins to step towards the dojo floor.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"The irritation on her face vanishes in an instant.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Her troubles with Akari are one matter, but the blade is another matter entirely.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"With impeccable form, she runs through the basic kata one by one with exacting precision.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"She shows no hesitation, her movements as smooth as the face of a mirror.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono, her father, once likened her technique to a cool breeze.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Sitting upright and watching her bladesmanship is a daily ritual that sets my heart at ease.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"If the war hadn't broken out, we would have surely lived out the rest of our peaceful days just like this...",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Up for a spar?”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Hotori and I face each other in the center of the dojo.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"In the hands of a warrior, even mere wooden blades are deadly weapons.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"The tension in the air is so thick as to almost be audible.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Poised with her blade pointed perfectly between my eyes, Hotori looks like a dignified wildflower.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Teeeeeeeiiiii!”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Her razor-sharp battle cry pierces the silence.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"She thrusts with blinding speed.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"The tip of her blade reaches for my throat faster than the speed of sound.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"I block it close to my body, immediately sliding my blade down to strike at the tendons on her forearm.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"The inside of the arm is a weak point even for an armored foe.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Even the slightest touch would be enough to decide the battle.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"But the wrist I was aiming for vanishes.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Hotori had let go of her blade with that hand.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kuh!”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"My counterattack is a moment too slow.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Hotori is not one to let that opening slip by.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"She gathers all her strength into an overhand slash that descends towards my head.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Her technique is like a tempest.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"I step to the right, open my body wide, and aim for Hotori's carotid artery.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"My blade draws a narrow arc, closing in on her neck.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"She has no defenses there.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"My blade easily cuts through to the bone, and gouts of blood slicken the dojo floor in a single heartbeat.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"─That is, if I were using a real blade.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"Hotori's blade slices through empty air, and mine stops perfectly before her neck.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Hotori's eyes are filled with astonishment.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"I can definitely understand why.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“One more round.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wouldn't have it any other way!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Hotori readies her blade once again.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Teaaaaaaaa!”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"After five bouts, we pause to catch our breath.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, you were on fire today. I can't believe you took two points off me.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You weren't going all-out, though. Am I wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Well, you've got me there, but still...”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Before the war, Hotori and I were assistant instructors at the Myougikan.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"In other words, our skills were evenly matched.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"But then, I lost my memories, and look at me now.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I just hope I get back my old skills by the time of our uprising.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The more you try to rush things, the more those thoughts will turn your blade awry.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Remember our precept: 'heart and blade in concord.'”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're exactly right.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"We smile at each other and wipe our sweat.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But I really mean it. You were moving totally different today!”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Did you do some special training or what?”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm just in really good shape.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hmm, really now...”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The way I see it, it's more like, you know, you got a little bit of your old self back.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“My old self?”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“From before the war. Back then, you had this mysterious intensity about you, totally separate from your bladework.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“When we faced off just now, it felt like I'd lost before the battle even began, or that even if I'd won, it wouldn't have been a true victory.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sure you're not imagining things?”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Father said the same thing, so I don't think I'm wrong.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kokuan-dono did too?”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"If the master said it, it must be true.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Your blade just now, it kinda reminded me of those good old times.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's cause to celebrate, right?”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You bet it is.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Hotori smiles wider than if she'd been praised herself.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Any ideas why?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If you can figure it out, maybe you'll get your old form back faster if you keep it up.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I have a good guess, actually...”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Really? What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Hotori's cheeks flush with excitement.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Hotori easily forgets herself when it comes to matters of the blade.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"I find this side of her unequivocally adorable.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's because of Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"When Hotori gives me a puzzled look, I tell her about the time I saved Akari.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"I deflected innumerable bullets with a single swing of my blade.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Judging by the state of the surroundings, I'd performed the Sickle Leaf, a secret technique among secret techniques.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"It's said that in the past hundred years, none but Kokuan-dono have mastered the Sickle Leaf.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"And yet I somehow actually used it.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ummm, so you're saying you suddenly managed to use the Sickle Leaf just because you needed it to save Miyaguni?”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I guess so.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You guess so? Come on.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I mean, this is unheard of! Sure, people sometimes manage to do crazy things in desperate situations, but really, now...”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I know what I did back there.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And I think it's related to how good my form is today.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“All thanks to Miyaguni, you used the Sickle Leaf, and\nyou're fit as a fiddle.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“At this rate, you just might find yourself an adorable girlfriend, and win the lottery to boot.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It all sounds too convenient to be true.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"But even as Hotori needles me sarcastically, I respond with all seriousness.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Meeting Akari changed me.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It feels like all the things holding me down have all but disappeared.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I have no proof, but I know just how much I've changed better than anyone else.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I get it already.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Hotori looks away with a strained expression.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You don't have to get so worked up about it.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“How could I not tell after we crossed blades and everything? How many years do you think we've been training together?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Hotori turns her back to me and hangs her wooden blade on the wall.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Honestly, I wanna get angry at you for being so gung-ho about sticking with Miyaguni.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But hey, the blade never lies.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And your blade has changed a lot since even just yesterday. It's like you're a totally different person.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And if you say it's all because to Miyaguni, as much as I hate to admit it, that just might be true.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Hotori turns towards me with a lonely smile on her lips.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"She's always been taking care of me in the hopes that I'd someday regain my former strength.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"It's all thanks to her that I'm able to live a normal life even without my memories.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"That her devotion to me goes far beyond mere friendship... is a fact that I couldn't possibly fail to notice.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"But I can't lie to myself either.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"My lord is Akari and Akari alone.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I get it, okay?”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That girl is someone special to you. I get it...”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Hotori murmurs, her voice barely above a whisper.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"I want to apologize, but I mustn't.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If Akari is who she says she is, she will be an invaluable rallying point for the Sworn Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is it so wrong to keep her beside me until we find proof of her lineage?”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If she has no proof now, she's nothing but a pretender to the throne. Someone who can't be allowed to live.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We need to be patient. For the sake of our future.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And what if she goes after Okonogi again while we're just sitting back, being patient?”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If she does anything reckless, that'll bring trouble to the Sworn Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll keep an eye on her so she doesn't act out.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm against the assassination in the first place. Okonogi needs to be disposed of, but in the right way.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And what if she doesn't give up?”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"Hotori crosses her arms.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Will you kill her?”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Would you really bring yourself to kill her? She's someone special to you, isn't she?”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I will.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"That's my responsibility for saving the life of an attempted assassin.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And then, I'll follow her in death.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Hotori peers at me with an indescribable expression on her face, equal parts furious and on the verge of tears.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"But as hardened of an expression as it is, it seems like she'd shatter with just one touch from me.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, you jerk.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"Her whisper is so quiet I can only barely hear it.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm begging you! Please just look the other way.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This isn't only about her lineage. I feel like my memories will come back if I stay with her.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I also want to know why my bladework improved so much.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“All right, all right. Enough.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"She waves her hand and interrupts me.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So? How long am I supposed to put up with her?”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How about until the anniversary?”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm going to settle my differences with her by then, too.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hmm... two more weeks, is it?”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm begging you.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"Without replying, Hotori takes up her wooden blade again.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Honestly, part of me hopes she's the real deal.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That'd be a real blessing for us.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If we have the Imperial standard on our side, all the warriors who've hung up their blades will surely come back to us.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"Hotori steps closer to me.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“As acting chairman, I swear to take Okonogi down. No matter what.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's the only way I can lay Father and all our fallen comrades to rest.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Over thirty thousand souls.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"That is the burden that Hotori carries on her back.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"We may both be warriors, but I only know of this tragedy through hearsay. That makes a world of difference.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“By all rights, I really should cut Miyaguni down.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But right now, I also feel like I should be taking advantage of every option at my disposal.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If she can help us hasten the Republic's defeat by even a single day, I'm sure Her Majesty will forgive us.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"It seems Hotori has reached her own conclusion.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll consider whatever is in the Blades' best interests when dealing with her.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But I'm not going to treat her with kid gloves like you do.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If the time ever comes, I hope you'll understand.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"Hotori is clearly worried that I'll grow soft on Akari.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Considering that I feel my destiny lies with her, that's a very real possibility.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No matter what happens, I'd never begrudge you.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Hotori's expression softens.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Just checking, but have you told her about the Sworn Blades?”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I haven't yet.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's still too soon to tell her.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"It's strictly forbidden to reveal the existence of the Sworn Blades without express permission.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"As the inspector general, I can't go about breaking the rules.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“She may have won you over, but you're still following the rules. Good job. I'm proud of you.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll leave the decision to tell her up to you from now on.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Though it'd be for the best if you didn't need to tell her.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"When the Sworn Blades were exposed two years ago during the affair known as the August Incident, it was generally thought that we were completely destroyed.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"Only a select few are aware that we've merely gone underground.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Of those around me, only the manager and Mutsumi-san know.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"The tried-and-true method to prevent leaks is to limit the number of people who hold the information.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's all from me.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"With that, Hotori readies her wooden blade.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"When I return home, I find Akari looking out over the city from the window.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"My room is directly above the shop. Facing the building,\nAkari's is immediately left of that.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Morning, Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, Soujin. Morning.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"Akari and Hotori wordlessly make eye contact.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Two weeks.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll look the other way for two weeks, and no longer.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If anything at all happens, Soujin's the one who'll take responsibility. Think long and hard before you do anything stupid.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"Akari's face lights up.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thank you, Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No thanks necessary.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"Hotori ends the conversation in a businesslike manner and promptly walks away.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? You're not gonna have breakfast together?”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori always makes sure to take a bath first.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“She doesn't need to know that!”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"Hotori thumps me on the back and heads home, her face bright red.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, is it fun embarrassing girls like that?”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I merely stated the truth.”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I had a bad feeling about this from the start... You're a real piece of work, aren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"She says with a dismayed expression.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And yet, Inou's still gonna come bring you breakfast after,\nisn't she?”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. She's a real lifesaver.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"After the war, she picked up the habit of always bringing me food on the days we train together.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"Thanks to that, I can enjoy a luxurious breakfast just by putting on some rice.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou's sure got it bad. I feel for her...”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"Shrugging my shoulders, I head up to my room.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
